WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.970
- All right, y'all, we've
reached the end of the hour,

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:04.240
but we still have time
for one more great story.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.411
This is "What I'm Liking".

00:00:05.411 --> 00:00:08.710
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:12.210
It's no secret that I am
obsessed with Christmas music.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.150
It's out there.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.280
And I recently learned about
an awesome acapella group

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.080
that's gone super viral
for their holiday music.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.580
In fact, their videos have amassed

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.200
more than 3.5 million
followers on TikTok alone.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.590
Not only did they just put out

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.490
their very own EP called
"Like It's Christmas",

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:30.370
where they cover some holiday classics,

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm also humbled to say they
did a really rad version

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:35.457
of my new Christmas song

00:00:35.457 --> 00:00:36.800
"Christmas Isn't Canceled (Just You)".

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.817
It's amazing. Check this out.

00:00:38.817 --> 00:00:42.484
♪ I'll be hanging every
light I find in this house ♪

00:00:42.484 --> 00:00:45.497
♪ Playing Christmas music so loud ♪

00:00:45.497 --> 00:00:50.330
♪ This year Christmas
won't be quite so blue ♪

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.377
♪ Pa-ra-pa-ra-pa-ra ♪

00:00:51.377 --> 00:00:54.577
♪ And I'm gonna shout too
loud and dance in the snow ♪

00:00:54.577 --> 00:00:57.577
♪ Drink too much just to let us go ♪

00:00:57.577 --> 00:01:02.228
♪ Christmas won't be canceled, just you ♪

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.423
♪ Pow ♪

00:01:03.423 --> 00:01:04.430
(audience cheering)
- I loved it.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.960
It's like a different form of...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.063
Can you imagine opening your
door to carolers singing that?

00:01:09.063 --> 00:01:10.690
I just think it's funny.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:12.470
We have The Trills on the line right now.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:15.060
Let's say hi to Will, Aaron, Missy, Nick,

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.292
Kathryn, and Leroy!

00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:17.476
(audience cheering)

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:18.309
- Hi!
- Hi.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.700
- Literally, when I saw this,
I was like, "Oh, my God."

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:22.690
One, you sound amazing.

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:24.870
And two, I was like, "I need
you to go around America

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.440
to every tour just singing this song

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.181
like it's a happy carol."

00:01:28.181 --> 00:01:29.290
(chuckles) I was like, "Awesome."

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.640
It's great to meet
y'all. You are so gifted.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:33.800
So can you tell us more about your group?

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:34.990
- Nice to meet you.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.140
- Nice to meet you too.

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:40.140
- So we started in
college, our freshman year.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.910
We met at Towson University in Maryland

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.720
and very quickly, we discovered

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.760
that we all had something in common.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.140
So by day three of college,

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:51.820
we had an acapella
group started in a dorm,

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:55.430
and then we auditioned in some
new friends and here we are.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:56.263
- [Kelly] It's so cool.

00:01:56.263 --> 00:01:57.240
- And it's wild to see it six years later

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:58.830
that the music continued to happen.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:01.080
Obviously, we all come
from different backgrounds.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:02.510
I played trumpet my whole life.

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:05.020
I actually lost the ability to
play trumpet around college.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:07.120
So I was able to transition to acapella

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.750
right when Trills was starting

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.940
and having a musical outlet
for the last six years.

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:13.320
So it's really important to all of us.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.153
- Yeah. Oh, my gosh.

00:02:14.153 --> 00:02:15.510
It's so therapeutic, music.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:18.270
So I love that you found that new outlet.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.700
So Will, how does it
feel to attract millions

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.623
and billions of fans on TikTok?

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.270
- It's honestly surreal.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.990
Like even beyond the numbers
and like the followers

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.200
that are like constantly growing,

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.160
it's just really cool to see

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:32.250
that there are people all over the world

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.470
who really care about our music,

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:34.670
who care about what we're doing,

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:36.290
even as people like following us

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:37.850
and messaging us personally,

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:39.270
and just like wanting to be excited

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:40.660
for all the projects that we're doing.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.980
It's really awesome.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:43.960
- Aw, that's so cool. Well,
thank you all so much.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:46.240
It's literally like I
have a whole new like skit

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:47.896
I want to do with caroling,

00:02:47.896 --> 00:02:49.800
with songs that might be inappropriate

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.970
to go house to house with.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.500
I think it's funny.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.816
But I'm liking your
poster right now, right?

00:02:54.816 --> 00:02:56.552
(audience clapping)

00:02:56.552 --> 00:02:58.351
(Trills members cheering)

00:02:58.351 --> 00:02:59.790
All right. That's not all.

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:02.430
Our season long partner,
Pilot Pen makers of G2,

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:04.150
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson show

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:07.050
want to honor ultimate
overachievers just like y'all.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:10.330
So in honor of you and
how you inspire others

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.310
to chase their dreams,
they are writing a check

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.854
for a thousand dollars to
Education Through Music.

00:03:14.854 --> 00:03:17.252
(audience cheering)

